{"title":"最小 Tap Game","summary":"一个单文件最小点击游戏：点击圆形目标得分，30 秒倒计时，结束后可重新开始。","html":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>最小 Tap Game</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg1: #0f172a;
      --bg2: #1e293b;
      --card: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      --text: #e2e8f0;
      --accent: #22c55e;
      --accent2: #06b6d4;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1d4ed8 0%, var(--bg1) 35%, #020617 100%);
    }
    .game {
      width: min(92vw, 440px);
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: var(--card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }
    .hud {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .stat {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .arena {
      position: relative;
      height: 420px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), rgba(255,255,255,0.03));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }
    .target {
      position: absolute;
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #86efac, var(--accent) 55%, #15803d 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(34,197,94,0.45);
      cursor: pointer;
      touch-action: manipulation;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);
      transition: transform 0.08s ease;
    }
    .target:active { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.94); }
    .overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: rgba(2,6,23,0.55);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .panel {
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.9);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      width: min(100%, 280px);
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    p { margin: 0 0 14px; opacity: 0.9; }
    button.start {
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent2), var(--accent));
      cursor: pointer;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="game">
    <div class="hud">
      <div class="stat">分数: <span id="score">0</span></div>
      <div class="stat">时间: <span id="time">30</span>s</div>
    </div>
    <div class="arena" id="arena">
      <button class="target" id="target" aria-label="tap target"></button>
      <div class="overlay" id="overlay">
        <div class="panel">
          <h1>Tap Game</h1>
          <p>30 秒内尽量多点绿色圆点。</p>
          <button class="start" id="startBtn">开始</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const arena = document.getElementById('arena');
    const target = document.getElementById('target');
    const scoreEl = document.getElementById('score');
    const timeEl = document.getElementById('time');
    const overlay = document.getElementById('overlay');
    const startBtn = document.getElementById('startBtn');

    let score = 0;
    let time = 30;
    let timer = null;
    let playing = false;

    function moveTarget() {
      const rect = arena.getBoundingClientRect();
      const size = 72;
      const x = Math.random() * (rect.width - size) + size / 2;
      const y = Math.random() * (rect.height - size) + size / 2;
      target.style.left = x + 'px';
      target.style.top = y + 'px';
    }

    function startGame() {
      score = 0;
      time = 30;
      playing = true;
      scoreEl.textContent = score;
      timeEl.textContent = time;
      overlay.style.display = 'none';
      moveTarget();
      clearInterval(timer);
      timer = setInterval(() => {
        time -= 1;
        timeEl.textContent = time;
        if (time <= 0) endGame();
      }, 1000);
    }

    function endGame() {
      clearInterval(timer);
      playing = false;
      overlay.style.display = 'grid';
      overlay.querySelector('.panel').innerHTML = '<h1>时间到</h1><p>最终分数: ' + score + '</p><button class="start" id="restartBtn">再来一次</button>';
      document.getElementById('restartBtn').addEventListener('click', startGame, { once: true });
    }

    target.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (!playing) return;
      score += 1;
      scoreEl.textContent = score;
      moveTarget();
    });

    startBtn.addEventListener('click', startGame);
    moveTarget();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"}

